name verbatlas-bn2wn
# bn2wn.tsv: "A mapping from BabelNet synset to WordNet synset for verbs. Each line contains a BabelNet synset ID and
# its corresponding WordNet synset ID, separated by a tab", bn:00082116v wn:00865776v. A table of keys: both name the
# one WordNet synset, which CILI names by its offset and the letter of its type (00865776-v). The highway keeps both as
# keys of that concept; nothing is said here. Its first line is BabelNet's banner, written as a comment.
match bn2wn.tsv

tier row by \n
comment hash
names bn wn
tier field by \t

omit bn wn

alias ili row bn to wn matching ^wn:([0-9]+)([a-z])$ as \1-\2
alias ili row wn to wn matching ^wn:([0-9]+)([a-z])$ as \1-\2
